{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53468","headline":"又颂 · 天然","name":"又颂","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"丹霞有一宝，藏之岁月久。\n从来人不识，余自独防守。\n山河无隔碍，光明处处透。\n体寂常湛然，莹澈无尘垢。\n世间采取人，颠狂逐路走。\n余则爲渠说，抚掌笑破口。\n忽遇解空人，放旷在林薮。\n相逢不擎出，举意便知有。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"天然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53468.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53468","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}